---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { CodeBlock } from "astro-ink";
---
<Base title="CodeBlock">
  <div class="docs-page">
    <h1>CodeBlock</h1>
    <p class="docs-lede">
      Code samples with a language label and a working copy button. No
      highlighter dependency: structure first, color later.
    </p>

    <h2>Example</h2>
    <div class="docs-example" style="display: grid;">
      <span class="docs-example-label" aria-hidden="true">Example</span>
      <CodeBlock language="bash" code="npm install astro-ink" />
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;CodeBlock language="bash" code="npm install astro-ink" /&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>Props</h2>
    <table class="docs-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>code</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Source text (required).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>language</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>text</code></td><td>Label shown in the bar.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <ul class="docs-list">
      <li>Copy feeds the real clipboard and confirms via the button label.</li>
      <li>Long lines scroll inside the block; the page never overflows.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
